  "theorem_contract": {
    "asymptotic_norm": "Pairing a 1-o(1) fraction of Theta(k) good blocks gives r=Theta(k), hence ||F'_nu||>=2^(r-k) and rules out every uniform poly(n)2^-k residual norm bound.",
